@startuml
title new Wholesale Broadband - High Level View

box "Wholebuyer" #E0E0E0
  participant "BuyerGW" as BuyerGW
end box
box "Wholeseller" #E0E0E0
  participant "SellerGW" as SellerGW
  participant "Location Management\nTMFC014" as LocationMgt #E5DCF0
  participant "Product Configurator\nTMFC027" as ProductConfigurator #E5DCF0
  participant "Appointment Management" as AppointmentMgt
  participant "Product Order Capture & Validation\nTMFC002" as POCV #E5DCF0
end box

== Address Validation ==

note over BuyerGW, SellerGW : The address with (partial) textual fields\nmust be mapped to an identifiable address\nin the Seller address repository

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 1 Search for address - TMF673 AddressValidation
SellerGW -> LocationMgt : 2 POST /geographicAddressValidation (textual fields)
LocationMgt --> SellerGW : 3 200 OK (normalized address, site & geo refs)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 4 Address response\n(need to consider site and geographic locations)

== New WBAccess Product Offering Qualification ==

note over BuyerGW, SellerGW : Qualification based on address

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 5 Find products - TMF 679 ProductQualification
SellerGW -> ProductConfigurator : 6 POST /productOfferingQualification
ProductConfigurator --> SellerGW : 7 201 Created (eligible product offerings + reasons)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 8 Product availability response

== Technician Appointment (optional) ==

note over BuyerGW, SellerGW
  Appointments are required when installation
  work in the customer premise is required.
  The qualification result should provide this info.
end note

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 9 Search for timeslots - TMF 646 Appointment\n(consider Journey, skills and hazards filters)
SellerGW -> AppointmentMgt : 10 GET /appointment/timeSlot?filters=journey,skills,hazards
AppointmentMgt --> SellerGW : 11 200 OK (available timeslots)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 12 Available timeslots

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 13 Reserve appointment - TMF 646 Appointment
SellerGW -> AppointmentMgt : 14 POST /appointment/reservation
AppointmentMgt --> SellerGW : 15 201 Created (appointment reserved)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 16 Appointment reserved

== WBAccess Order ==

note over BuyerGW, SellerGW : Order can be placed with\nall required products

BuyerGW -> SellerGW : 17 Place order - TMF 622 Product Order
activate SellerGW

note over SellerGW : Syntax validation, id generation, timestamp

alt Decomposed Product Model (explicit actions)

    SellerGW -> POCV : 18 Create Product Order with orderItems:\n- FTTH WSBB Access (new product) ............ action="add"\n- G500 - WSBB Bitstream Profile (new product)  action="add"\n- Local - WSBB Bitstream Transport (new) ..... action="add"
    POCV --> SellerGW : 19 201 Created (state="acknowledged")

else Combined Product Model

    SellerGW -> POCV : 20 Create Product Order with orderItems:\n- FTTH WSBB Bitstream Combined (new product) .. action="add"
    POCV --> SellerGW : 21 201 Created (state="acknowledged")

end

POCV -> SellerGW : 22 POST ProductOrderCreateEvent(acknowledged)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 23 Order Created Event "acknowledged"

POCV -> SellerGW : 24 POST ProductOrderStateChangeEvent(accepted)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 25 Order State Update Event "accepted"

POCV -> SellerGW : 26 POST ProductOrderStateChangeEvent(inProgress)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 27 Order State Update Event "inProgress"

POCV -> SellerGW : 28 POST ProductOrderMilestoneEvent(committed)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 29 Order Milestone Event "committed"

POCV -> SellerGW : 30 POST ProductOrderStateChangeEvent(serviceActivated)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 31 Order State Update Event "Service Activation"

POCV -> SellerGW : 32 POST ProductOrderStateChangeEvent(completed)
SellerGW --> BuyerGW : 33 Order State Update Event "complete"
deactivate SellerGW

@enduml
